    heroText: "In a fast-paced digital world, quality assurance is critical to product success. Wugweb's QA and software testing services ensure your applications are reliable, high-performing, and user-ready.",
    body: 'We build quality into every stage of the digital lifecycle. Our QA and software testing services align with your business goals and reduce risk. Through smart planning, advanced tools, and a focus on software reliability, we help you deliver trusted digital products.',
